      "confidence": "verified-live",
      "notes": "Category NAMES resolved via the categories companion (multilingual name → first value). Full hierarchical path (Root > … > Leaf) would require walking id_parent — declared as a canon-evolution gap and preserved verbatim in sourceExtension."
