      "notes": "Axis of variation derived by walking every combination of this product (companions.variations) through the two companion lookups productOptionValues (id → axis id + value label) and productOptions (axis id → axis label). Ordered by axis position, then by value position — same rule Shopware's options_from_settings applies."
    },
    {
      "path": "associations.product_features",
      "canon": "attributesRich[]",
      "transform": "lookup",
      "args": {
        "in": "productFeatureValues",
        "key": "id",
        "multiple": true,
        "fields": {
          "name": {
            "path": "id_feature",
            "ref": {
              "in": "productFeatures",
              "key": "id",
              "pick": "name"
            }
          },
          "values": {
            "path": "value",
            "as": "first_value"
          }
        }
      },
      "confidence": "verified-live",
      "notes": "Descriptive product features (Composition = Polyester, Property = Ceramic, …). Each association carries the feature-value id; the value's id_feature resolves the feature's name through the productFeatures companion."
    },
